  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NELSAP-Mara,Kagera,SMM transboundary rivers - NELSAP- Nile Equatorial Lakes 2013-2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NELSAP-Mara,Kagera,SMM vattenresursf&#xf6;rvaltning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NELSAP &#xe4;r ett av tre center under Nileninitiativet. Projeketet        arbetar f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad vattenresursf&#xf6;rvaltning och utveckling genom   f&#xf6;rstudier f&#xf6;r infrastruktur f&#xf6;r bevattning och sm&#xe5;skalig vattenkraft i flodomr&#xe5;dena Mara, Kagera och Sio-Malaba-Malakisi.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Nile Equatorial Lakes Subsidiary Action Program (NELSAP) works    within the frame work of Nile Basin Initiative. The project is        managed by NELSAP and works for improved water mangement and to       prepare infrastructure investments in water storage, in the Mara      (between Kenya &amp; Tanzania), Kagera (Burundi, Rwanda, Tanzania &amp;       Uganda) and Sio-Malaba-Malakisi (Kenya &amp;Uganda) river basins.</narrative>
  </description>
